and depression are bidirectional; (7) **Caregiver and community health worker** involvement. The **Area Agency on Aging (AAA)** is the primary local gateway for all these services. (Ref: Hazzard''s Ch. 17; AGS Geriatrics At Your Fingertips; Current Diagnosis & Treatment: Geriatrics)'),
